{"summary":"Unleash your puzzle-solving skills with 9 addictive games and over 500 images!","description":"With the ability to add your own custom images/photos, this game offers hours of engaging picture-puzzle gameplay.\n\nIMAGEine Premium features nine relaxing puzzle games that can be played at your own pace, but also 42 optional challenges (each with special game rules) for those that seek some thrill.\n\nYou will love the classic games like Jigsaw Puzzle, Memory, and Fifteen/Eight Puzzle, as well as the original games like \"Circles\", \"Swap\", \"Slider\", \"Discs\", \"Blocks\", and \"Segtor\".\n\nEach game has multiple difficulty settings, making it suitable for small children and experienced puzzle enthusiasts alike. A typical game on the easiest difficulty will take less than a minute to complete, while the hardest puzzles can take much longer.\n\nExperience the fun and challenge of IMAGEine Premium - if you can imagine it, you can play it!\n\n* IMAGEine Premium has been awarded \"App of The Day\" by MyAppFree.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ultMf0Xy2FQ?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FavlF5CAm8dMoEPpK5-c8TRrNv4qu8hMiK8GoFr3iLXmCVHMRl6l6jjhTk8AIKeo_q2W9-ZCE7tDP7nWz6H4","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/joaRg9JlR82RC5-8yQoYbb7qOtFCkPR41c7z8t5gCSEjwexMaGjPYXH13uPbP35K5hu8SfpK4EcJDrQirpEK","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/56sl5E6SZ44cPWzylSgD_bAvaW62_j_3U7ffTqJzmj2rfmm6mifyhqGoSeIQ9XI6YnSVCry9PvKVMWGh-cwiuks","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xBjtpGh3URB4bJ0WZmxcLlByAkrmQc71lF-MDUQiRKSIJqkph7cMiTOUIiEkucw5Uwy-3y4fHsEPOjmMXiN0qtA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pZaD1YZOFqQ1D4bf7wEeLiKrhrhr2VsQTwUzHYWXEs4_mx0tLLJr-OC3OmyIINimNE3ABZta_QmFF0BRTwKd5A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jbUqmHocesXPxqABBTJTMQe5_gnpKHxa4VHnq36mo1rESP5YNqfkSQnnQaWQkzlQ6C62IbHCYGKOdr0AHBba","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B